window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Secrets and lies set lives on fire....</b></p> <p>Mine was burnt to a crisp, all because I allowed myself to fall for my brother's best friends. They turned against me and chose their friendship over me…again.</p> <p>The Filthy Few got what they wanted; their favor was granted, and they collected the debt in the form of my freedom and heart.</p> <p>I vowed to them all that night that I would end them after I claimed my rightful place as the Lordess of the Haven Saints, making myself Forever Filthy.</p> <p>They may have been the kings of this town once, but I was born to lead, and it's about damn time I took control of what is rightfully mine.</p> <p>After a year of them being banished and no masked men sightings since the Night of the Saints, three masked men return to Hollow Hills, and this time they refuse to leave until I ask a favor.</p> <p>A favor asked is a debt owed....</p> <p>They are the Filthy Few, but I am Vivivan Tempest, and I will be Forever Filthy.</p> <p><i>This is book two in the world of the Filthy Few and the Dirty Temptation series. This is a dark secret society with heavy spice and masked men. Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
